WEBVTT

00:00:29.545 --> 00:00:34.103
and when her efforts were honored in 2011,

00:00:34.103 --> 00:00:37.543
and she was given the national youth peace prize,

00:00:37.543 --> 00:00:39.412
and she became a very famous,

00:00:39.412 --> 00:00:43.456
very popular young girl of her country.

00:00:43.456 --> 00:00:46.784
Before that, she was my daughter,

00:00:46.784 --> 00:00:49.789
but now I am her father.

00:00:50.741 --> 00:00:52.496
Ladies and gentlemen,

00:00:52.496 --> 00:00:55.643
if we glance to human history,

00:00:55.643 --> 00:00:58.471
the story of women

00:00:58.471 --> 00:01:01.847
is the story of injustice,